⚠️ If it says **FORMAT DRIFT**, stop and paste me the output — that means Qwen writes a record type the adapter doesn't know.\n\n---\n\n# Test 5 — Qwen headless (30 seconds)\n\nSame terminal, still has the env vars:\n```bash\ncd ~/tmp/cledger-smoke\nqwen -p \"say hi in one word\"\nnode ~/tmp/cledger-check.mjs 5\n```\n\n**Expected:** the event count went *up* versus Test 4. This is the case the `>/dev/null 2>&1` redirect exists for — if it captured, the workaround is doing its job.\n\n---\n\nRun them in order and paste me whatever the checker prints — including passes, since the detail lines tell me things the PASS/FAIL doesn't. If any step's UI doesn't look like I described, stop and tell me rather than guessing; Gemini and Qwen both moved versions under us today.\n\nresult:\nFixed 4 defects (pushed: 3eeeada, 2f470e2), verified Test 1 passes on real Gemini data with no double-emitted tool calls, and set up babied step-by-step instructions for Tests 2-5 plus a PASS/FAIL checker at ~/tmp/cledger-check.mjs, hook error visibility restored, and a free local endpoint for the Qwen tests.","type":"text"}],"diagnostics":null,"id":"msg_011CdkxSVpYb6vmLMdaw5HBy","model":"claude-opus-5","role":"assistant","stop_details":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":495,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"cache_creation_input_tokens":495,"cache_read_input_tokens":248962,"inference_geo":"not_available","input_tokens":2,"iterations":[{"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":495,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"cache_creation_input_tokens":495,"cache_read_input_tokens":248962,"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2899,"type":"message"}],"output_tokens":2899,"server_tool_use":{"web_fetch_requests":0,"web_search_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","speed":"standard"}},"parentUuid":"e4038e88-2e37-4573-8382-8e3f2dd0112c","requestId":"req_011CdkxSNfBqmAo8jLLG1c4Q","sessionId":"d10310cd-8144-4046-87b9-97bbb6ace18